esxDOS (c) 2005-2021 Papaya Dezign.

These are esxDOS 0.8.5, 0.8.6, 0.8.7, 0.8.8 and 0.8.9 exactly as Papaya Dezign
released them (http://www.esxdos.org/files/esxdos085.zip ... esxdos089.zip),
each in a folder of its own: the divMMC firmware ESXMMC.BIN (ESXMMC.ROM in
0.8.6), the SYS and BIN folders a card needs, README.TXT and the release's NFO.
No file was modified.

They are redistributed with Xpeccy+ with the permission of Papaya Dezign. Many
thanks to Miguel Guerreiro / Papaya Dezign for allowing esxDOS to be bundled.

Xpeccy+ itself is distributed under the MIT license (see LICENSE_eng /
LICENSE_rus in the root of the project); that license does not apply to the
files in this directory. config/roms/PROVENANCE.md lists them with their MD5.
